   },
   {
    "desc": "While within Dim Light or Darkness, you can give yourself the Invisible condition as a Bonus Action. The condition ends on you immediately after you take an action, a Bonus Action, or a Reaction."
   },
   {
    "desc": "While within Dim Light or Darkness, you have Resistance to all damage except Psychic and Radiant."
